sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Executive
    participant UI as Interface
    participant G as Guard
    participant A as Agent step
    participant M as Gemini
    participant Q as Query gateway
    participant B as BigQuery

    U->>UI: question
    UI->>G: check the text with rules,<br/>no model call
    alt blocked
        G-->>UI: fixed reply
    else allowed
        G->>A: question joins<br/>the conversation
        A->>M: rules, tone, brand scope,<br/>analyst examples, history
        M-->>A: tool call with SQL
        A->>Q: SQL from the model
        Q->>Q: parse, check allow-lists,<br/>rewrite for the brand scope,<br/>add LIMIT
        Q->>B: dry-run, free
        B-->>Q: bytes to scan,<br/>or an error
        Q->>B: execute
        B-->>Q: rows
        Q-->>A: rows after the PII scrub,<br/>or an error the model can act on
        A->>M: tool result
        M-->>A: answer
        A-->>UI: answer after the PII scrub
    end
    UI-->>U: answer and trace id
